{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s836b0e60c653eb59","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-6410237d7c9b43b89328","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s836b0e60c653eb59","text":"완벽한 각도! 정밀한 설계! 난 이미 여러 차례 측량했어. 이번엔 분명 성공할 수 있어, 징!","speaker":"찌부 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"찌부 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4694237706869154750"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15400121319507012177"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-47a49bb7615f7fd1b762","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s836b0e60c653eb59","text":"이제 거대한 돌을 미는 발동 장치만 남았어. 예술은 찌부러뜨리는 거야, 징!","speaker":"찌부 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"찌부 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18086431801476895405"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15400121319507012177"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-6bcd5848218c614f228e","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s836b0e60c653eb59","text":"오오오, 움직인다, 움직인다고, 징!","speaker":"찌부 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"찌부 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2372884087271472519"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15400121319507012177"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-4957ae7c76250bcdf38e","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s836b0e60c653eb59","text":"완벽한 각도! 정밀한 설계! 예술은 짓누르는 거야, 징!","speaker":"찌부 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"찌부 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4004922075394561842"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15400121319507012177"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-6410237d7c9b43b89328","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-6410237d7c9b43b89328","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s836b0e60c653eb59","scene":"찌부 벌레","contextId":